I just discovered a new bug in PL6, playing on Apollo 4500's.

I had been blessed with a scroll of punishment, so I was
dragging my ball and chain around.  I picked up my ball,
to use it as a weapon, and thus I only had my chain
trailing me.

What happened was that a cave spider started hiding under
my chain, and when I moved (not knowing about the spider),
I left chain (-) marks all over the dungeon.  After I
clobbered the spider and re-ran over the 'corrupted'
squares, everything was hunky-dory again.

